  "details": "1. Open VRChat and join instance.\n\n2. Having unstable connection, might be ISP issue.\n\n3. Connect to VPN in the middle of session, Then click rejoin the world.\n\n4. A popup said \"World is incompatible with current platform\" Even you tried to go home or other instance, It'll place you at error world.\n\nThis used to work before, around 2-3 month ago with a behavior of getting kicked out that said \"Time out\" (Make sense) but it reconnects using VPN network afterwords.",
